  "settingsDesktopLyricsGroupSubtitle": "Floating line and optional macOS menu bar",
  "settingsDesktopLyricsGroupDetail": "Desktop lyrics include a floating, draggable line above other windows and—on macOS—an optional compact line in the menu bar.\n\nFloating lyrics use the same lyric styling (colors, multi-line mode, translations) as the now playing screen. You can lock the window position, tune background opacity, and choose how many timed lines appear before and after the current line.\n\nMenu bar lyrics (macOS only) show a single compact line; enable the toggle when you want lyrics always visible without the floating window.",
